/-!
# Typing and compiler research profiles

Explicit umbrella for historical pattern-level type systems, relational profiles,
and main-line static checking/code-generation studies. These modules retain their
own definitions and theorems. They are not the runtime predicate-typing candidate;
its entry points are `Logic.ConstraintTypes` and `PeTTa.RuntimeTyping`.

The wider language catalogue and specification index import this umbrella
explicitly. Ordinary PeTTa imports no longer list these research profiles as part
of the runtime-typing interface. Individual research modules remain importable.
-/
